# Unity 的場景 / Prefab 是文字檔，統一換行符號，避免 Windows / Mac 組員之間出現整份檔案都被改掉的假差異
*.cs        text eol=lf
*.unity     text eol=lf
*.prefab    text eol=lf
# .asset 有些是二進位檔（地形、光照資料），用 text=auto 讓 git 自己判斷；強制 text 會刪掉資料裡的 CR 位元組，檔案就壞了
*.asset     text=auto eol=lf
*.mat       text eol=lf
*.meta      text eol=lf
*.controller text eol=lf
*.anim      text eol=lf
*.inputactions text eol=lf

# 二進位檔
*.fbx  binary
*.blend binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.zip  binary
*.wav  binary
*.mp3  binary
Assets/_Project/Models/Boss/**/*.fbx filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
Assets/_Project/Models/Boss/**/*.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
Assets/_Project/Models/Boss/**/*.PNG filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
Assets/_Project/Models/Boss/**/*.jpg filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
Assets/_Project/Models/Boss/**/*.jpeg filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
Assets/_Project/Models/Boss/**/*.JPEG filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
Assets/_Project/Models/Boss/*.zip filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.tif filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
